card.statement:
Each matrix of the form

\begin{equation}
A=\begin{bmatrix}
\lambda &a_{12}&\dots&a_{1n} \\
&\lambda&\ddots&\vdots \\
&&\ddots&a_{n-1,n}\\ 0&&&\lambda
\end{bmatrix},\qquad \text{all $a_{i,i+1}$ are positive real,}
\end{equation}

is fully determined by the indexed family of real numbers

\begin{equation}
\{\|h({A}_k)\|\}_{(h,k)},\qquad
\text{in which $h\in\mathbb C[x]$ and
$k=1,\dots,n.$}
\end{equation}
